Configure per-game Proton settings (HDR, Wayland, NGX updater, VKD3D heap).

Usage:
  spela proton [command]

Available Commands:
  reset       Make a Proton field follow All games
  set         Set Proton profile for a game
  show        Show Proton profile for a game

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for proton

Use "spela proton [command] --help" for more information about a command.
